      "writtenOn": "2025-10-30T01:44:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Our isolated services do not use binder communication and are therefore not registered in the binder table. Therefore we expect this to have no impact on the operation of binder freezer. Furthermore, we have continuously tested xTS and have not found any related issues to date.",
